 "title": "Cash Bids | Insight FS",
 "text": "Cash Bids | Insight FS Your Privacy Choices\nWe and our vendors use technology that collects data about your use of our site so we can improve and personalize our products and services, for analytics and marketing, and to fulfill your requests. We may also share this information with marketing vendors, social media companies, and analytics partners. By using our website, you acknowledge and agree to our Terms of Use. To learn more about our privacy practices review our Privacy Policy . P lease review your choices.\nDo Not Sell or Share My Personal Information\nSkip to Main Content FS Cooperatives\nOur Locations\nContact Us\nCareers\nNew Customer Application\nCash Bids\nmyFS Login\nAgriculture Agronomy\nmyFS Agronomy\nSeed\nAdjuvants\nCrop Protection\nPlant Performance\nCrop Nutrients\nNutrient Management\nEndure Carbon\nPrecision Equipment\nFS Agri-Finance\nEnergy\nCommercial Credit App\nPropane\nContracting Propane\nPropane Summer Fill\nFuels & Additives\nLubricants\nFAST STOP Gas Stations\nFeed & Nutrition\nDairy\nBeef\nPoultry\nCommodities\nSpecialty Feeds\nPlastics & Inoculants\nGrain Marketing\nCash Bids\nClosing Bids\nFutures\nSign Up for Text Alerts\nAll Ag Services\nAgriculture\nCommercial Energy\nCommercial Credit App\nPropane\nTransport\nFuels & Additives\nLubricants\nFAST STOP Gas Stations\nTurf\nTurf Seeds\nTurf Management\nBulk and Bagged Salt Ice Melt and Deicers\nFS Agri-Finance\nFS Agri-Finance\nAll Commercial Services\nCommercial\nResidential myFS Solution Center\nmyFS Solution Center\nEnergy\nConsumer Credit App\nPropane\nContracting Propane\nPropane Summer Fill\nFAST STOP Gas Stations\nHorse & Pet Food\nSpecialty Feeds\nAll Residential Services\nResidential\nNews & Resources News\nmyFS Solution Center\nCredit Applications\nAbout Us About Us\nFS Sustainability Commitments FS Cultivates Community\nFS Endure Carbon\nFS Proud\nThe FS Way\nCash Bids\nAt Insight FS, we meet your grain marketing needs by providing access to end user markets, competitive bids and pricing programs. Our experienced staff provides competitive prices, transportation needs, drying and storage service, and we take pride in unloading grain quickly during the high-volume harvest season so your operation doesn't experience bottlenecks. As a retail division of GROWMARK, Inc., Insight FS provides producers with access to world grain markets that enable you to plan your grain handling, storage and marketing activities to compliment your on-farm storage capabilities and achieve your profitability targets.\nInsight FS Grain Storage and Marketing Facilities\nIxonia, WI\nJefferson, WI\nWaupun, WI\nBrandon, WI\nAn undefined error has occurred - please contact support.\nIMPORTANT NOTICE\nInsight FS participates in Wisconsin's Agricultural Security program. If we fail to pay you for grain when payment is due, you may file a claim under this program. The program may reimburse up to 80% of the first $60,000 of your allowed claim, and up to 75% of any additional amount. For more information, you may contact the Wisconsin Department of Agriculture, Trade and Consumer Protection, 2811 Agriculture Drive, Madison, 53708-8911\nPhone: (608) 224-4998\nGrain closing bid sheet\nView Bids\nJefferson Main Office\n222 E. Puerner Street\nJefferson , WI 53549\n(920) 674 7000\nAgriculture\nCommercial\nResidential\nNews & Resources\nAbout Us\nOur Locations\nFS Sustainability Commitments\nCareers\nmyFS Agronomy\nEmployee Access\nSDS\nTerms of Use\nPrivacy Policy\nCredit Policy\n© Copyright 2026 GROWMARK, Inc.",
